<#78b4ff>SHUNPO  (FLASH STEP)</>
Shunpo (+ any direction)		^X
  Invincible flash step in 8 directions. Uses 1 stock.
  3 stocks (gauge at the bottom of the screen). One refills
  every 7 seconds.
Combo Shunpo (during any move)		^X
  Cancels any normal, special or super. Costs half a stock
  (taken from the refill bar first), or 1 bar when he is out
  of stock.
Guard Cancel Shunpo (blocking, 1 bar)		^X

<#78b4ff>BANKAI</>
Bankai (3 bars, 15 seconds)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Bankai (5 bars, 45 seconds)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Bankai normals. Zangetsu and Engetsu become their Bankai
  supers.

<#78b4ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Orihime Assist		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
  A: Tsubaki shot. B: barrier. C: floor trap. 5 second
  cooldown.
  Ground or air, or as a cancel from normals. She can be hit
  running off after C.
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
Air Dash (air)		_F_F

<#78b4ff>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
  Chains: Light into Medium into Heavy.
Launcher (jump cancel on hit)		_D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Charged Air Heavy (hold, air)		^C
  Full charge: ground bounce, then a hop to follow up. Once
  per combo.

<#78b4ff>SPECIALS</>
  The C version is the EX: costs 1 bar of power.
Zangetsu		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
  EX: the wave hits OTG and chains into the launcher.
Gazan		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
  Carries them up. EX: last hit ground bounces, then air
  follow-up.
Engetsu-zan		_B_DB_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Kongen-zan		_D_D^A / ^B / ^C

<#78b4ff>SUPERS</>
Getsuga Tensho (1 bar, OTG)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Issen (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_DB_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Bankai Getsuga Tensho (Bankai)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Bankai Engetsu (Bankai)		_B_DB_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
